      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work each square to seven rounds in DK on a 4 mm hook. Blocked size is approximately 30 cm square. For a smaller top work fewer rounds; for a larger top work more rounds or use a heavier yarn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Square count guide"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "All sizes use exactly four squares. Size is controlled by the number of rounds per square. XS: 5-round squares (approx 22 cm). S: 6-round squares (approx 26 cm). M: 7-round squares (approx 30 cm). L: 8-round squares (approx 34 cm). XL: 9-round squares (approx 38 cm). 2XL: 10-round squares (approx 42 cm)."
          }
        ]
      },
